---
page: Customer
---
# Exercises cross-page edges: an edge whose endpoints are declared on
# different pages is not drawn; the engine links each endpoint to the other.
# Drives the action tracer through cross-page validation, edge removal and
# link rendering.
general.VerticalContainer(customer, "Customer"):
    erd.EntityRect(account, "Account")
erd.ZeroToManyZeroToOne(account, contract, "pays")
---
page: Contract
---
general.VerticalContainer(contracts, "Contract"):
    erd.EntityRect(contract, "Contract")
    erd.EntityRect(appendix, "Appendix")
erd.OneToMany(contract, appendix, "has")
